SUMMARY:The Sermon: Houston Movie Premiere
DTSTAMP:20260705T141835Z
DTSTART:20260712T233000Z
DESCRIPTION:When faith turns into action\, the line between purpose and dan
	ger begins to blur. The Sermon premieres soon.\n\n\n\n\nJoin us for the of
	ficial premiere of The Sermon\, a powerful crime drama exploring the inter
	section of faith\, perception\, and consequence. Experience the film on th
	e big screen alongside\n\nhttps://thedeluxetheater.com/events/the-sermon-h
	ouston-movie-premiere/\n\nFrom The DeLUXE Theater Houston
URL:https://thedeluxetheater.com/events/the-sermon-houston-movie-premiere/
